# ── private / framework footprint (LOCAL ONLY — never committed to the public repo) ──
# The framework is the *process*, not the product. None of it ships publicly:
# a `git ls-files` on the public repo must return only shipped product code.
#
# IMPORTANT: a .gitignore does NOT untrack files already in git history. If the
# framework footprint was ever committed (it is, in a molded-in-place project),
# this file is necessary but NOT sufficient — the public repo must be created
# with a FRESH git history (a clean `git init` exporting only product files),
# then verified with `git ls-files` + a content grep for framework branding.
#
# Two independent IP controls (see ARCHITECTURE.md §9): (1) the framework source
# carries zero proprietary literals, and (2) this gitignore + a fresh history keep
# the whole framework footprint out of the public repo.

# Engineering instructions + the single integration point + the backlog
CLAUDE.md
framework.config.json
PRD.json

# Copied skills, adapters, scripts, doctrine, hooks, markers, reports, plugins,
# commands — the whole tree is local-only.
.claude/

# Recon / inventory artifacts (never ship)
.secret-manifest.tsv
.librarian-fingerprint
LIBRARIAN.md

# Knowledge substrate (discipline is portable; content is local). Includes the
# camp-0 engineering-spec / North-Star notes under learnings/.
knowledge-map.md
progress.txt
secops.md
learnings/
stack-documentation/

# Local SQLite stores (memory db, etc.)
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Local environment (the .env.example template stays committed)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# ── Framework-dev meta (NEVER ship — these document / build / attribute the
#    framework itself). NOTE: CREDITS.md and NOTICE credit the Atlas framework,
#    so they are IGNORED here. The product keeps its OWN README.md, LICENSE, and
#    SECURITY.md (committed), and REWRITES CHANGELOG.md / CONTRIBUTING.md / docs/
#    for itself — so those product paths are intentionally NOT ignored (the
#    consumer replaces their bodies; it does not hide them). ──────────────────
ARCHITECTURE.md
GENERICIZATION.md
QUICKSTART.md
CREDITS.md
NOTICE

# Framework tooling (the product's CLI entry is dist/cli.js, not bin/)
bin/
ci/

# Framework GitHub workflows only. Do NOT blanket-ignore .github/ — product CI
# (ci.yml, weekly-smoke.yml, dependabot.yml) lives under .github/.
.github/workflows/librarian-daily.yml
.github/workflows/publish-gate.yml

# ── Node / TypeScript build output ─────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
build/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ── OS / editor cruft ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
